Back up.

24
00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:00,440
- Oh, my god. - Look at that.

25
00:01:00,490 --> 00:01:03,240
- You made this? - Heck yeah. I went to the junkyard.

26
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,470
I have an account there.

27
