78
00:03:36,410 --> 00:03:39,030
Listen, "My name is Mandy, and I think 'iCarly'

79
00:03:39,130 --> 00:03:42,170
is the awesomest web show on the whole Internet."

80
00:03:42,330 --> 00:03:43,740
