142
00:06:43,020 --> 00:06:44,010
Yes, she does.

143
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:46,790
It's true. I do. This seat is comfortable.

144
00:06:47,910 --> 00:06:49,900
Go on, do your thing.

145
