So I don't get strawberry lumps stuck in my straw.

200
00:09:29,230 --> 00:09:30,640
Hey, that'd be a cool name for a band.

201
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:32,400
- Stuck in my straw? - Strawberry lumps.

202
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:32,830
Better.

203
